Call Coster V1.5.3e Shareware

By Peter Briggs

October 1996

Call Coster v1.5.3e for the Psion S3a allows you to monitor & record the cost of  Orange & BT originated telephone calls. Following the response to the freeware version 1.1 & 1.2 I have implemented a few suggestions, tidied up the interfaces a little, & fixed all the known bugs.

*** The are no differences in this evaluation versions 1.5.3e & version 1.5e except changes to this text file regarding the registration procedure & name changes to the files & directorys***

Major improvements to version 1.5.3e Evaluation Version are:
---------------------------------------------------------
 * No need to select time of call. It is now taken from system date & time on Psion.
 * Option to edit BT tarifs 
 * On-line Help
 * All required files in one folder (m:\app\callcost\)
 
BUG FIXES IN THIS VERSION ARE:
------------------------------
 * Corrected BT tarifs which were wrong in v1.3, as I added VAT
   when it was already included.
   N.B. Certain BT tariffs will be out of date from October 8th when BT introduces
   new tarifs for some national & international calls. Registration will ensure you are
   using a version of Call Coster with the correct rates.

 * Also corrected is the bug which only allowed you to add one call to the Calls List.

To Install Call Coster
----------------------
*** These directorys & files must be put on the Psion Internal drive (m:\) ***

The files included are:
CALLEVAL.OPA
CALLEVAL.PIC
CALLEVAL.RSC
README.1ST the file you are reading.

Create the folder \app\calleval\ 

Copy Calleval.pic & Calleval.rsc to \app\calleval\ directory

Copy Calleval.opa to \app\ directory

Then use <Psion I > to install Calleval.opa in the desired position.


Information
-----------
When you run the Call Coster for the first time the following tarif data files will be created in app\calleval\ directory (btdata.odb, ora1data.odb & ora2data.odb). Upon adding calls to the Call List another file called CALLDATA.ODB will be created in the same directory (unless you are upgrading & are using previously created Calls List).

On-line help is available upon pressing the <HELP> key.

REGISTRATION
------------
Call Coster v1.5.3e is Shareware if you find the program useful please register. The cost is £12 for this I will e-mail you the latest version (1.5.3) with all menu options enabled & no restrictions. Version 1.5.3 also includes:

 * Option to Select BT Discounts on calls (Family & Friends, Option 15,    Premierline, Option 15 with Family & Friends, Premierline with
   Family & Friends)

 * Option to set up a Regular Numbers List to enable consistent &
   faster input to Call log

 * Call Records/Log shows total time as well as total cost

 * Latest BT tarifs

 * Any new bug fixes

You will also receive updates by e-mail as they become available. I will also consider your suggestions for implementation into future versions of the program. It will also help me to develop the program further.

If you wish to register you can send a cheque for £12 to me (Peter Briggs) at 15 Poulton Road, Carleton, Poulton-le-Fylde, Lancashire, FY6 7NH.

Please also send me five improvements you would like to see in Call Coster when you register. 

